@support

D: support → opened → resolved → closed
I: customer → resolve
R: subject + message

B: open
→ diagnose
→ resolve
→ close

S:
  opened
  → diagnosing
  → resolved
  → closed

A:
  customer { request message }
  system { diagnose resolve close }

K resolve_case {
  in: subject + message
  rule: choose(resolution)
  out: resolution
  emit: case.resolved
}

E:
  request.received
  → case.diagnosed
  → case.resolved
  → case.closed

T:
  request.received
  → case.diagnosed
  → case.resolved
  → case.closed

X:
  ¬ close(case ≠ resolved)
